OL,3,GNEWSAThe school where pupils eat 'kilos
OL,4,Aof olives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen you think of school meals, beige
OL,7,Ffried food may spring to mind. But that
OL,8,Fis not the case at Landscore Primary
OL,9,FSchool in Devon.
OL,11,F"They love the salad bar. They ate
OL,12,Fkilos of olives last week, they love
OL,13,Fthe wholewheat flour," said head
OL,14,Fteacher Patrick Seller.
OL,16,FThe school adopted a healthy eating
OL,17,Fregime with help from the charity Chefs
OL,18,Fin Schools - making them a step ahead
OL,19,Fof a government policy due to take
OL,20,Feffect in 2027 that bans deep fried
OL,21,Ffood.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
